WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.935
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.370
We hope you're doing well.
And now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.438
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.406
President Biden spoke today at

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:10.143
a DNC event to thank staffers
and volunteers.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.679
Okay, but you know
who you really

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.180
need to be thanking, right?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.516
I mean, the way his endorsements
performed,

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:21.020
this man needs a fruit basket,
which would be a solid burn,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.590
because he doesn't eat fruit.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.057
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:27.327
Following Democrats'
surprisingly strong performance

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.963
in the midterms, White House
chief of staff Ron Klain

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.932
tweeted yesterday,
"Never underestimate how much

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.667
Team Biden is underestimated."

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:37.670
[ Laughter ]
And wow, what a rallying cry.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.904
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:41.341
That's like if Coach Taylor
said, "Clear eyes,

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.342
full hearts, everyone thinks
we're going to lose.

00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:44.944
But guess what.
We're not going to lose

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.546
by as much as everyone thought

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.781
and we're going to call
that a win.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:50.149
Go get 'em."

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.450
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.686
Former President Trump's
daughter Tiffany is reportedly

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.888
worried that Tropical Storm
Nicole will ruin

00:00:55.888 --> 00:00:57.690
her wedding this weekend
at Mar-a-Lago.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.891
Though if I were her,

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:01.460
I'd be more worried about
this tropical depression.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.531
[ Laughter ]
Just moping around, complaining

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:07.867
about the midterms, jumping in
front to catch the bouquet,

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:11.104
and yelling, "This means
I'm the nominee in 2024."

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.373
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.942
Allies of former President Trump
are reportedly telling him

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:19.011
to delay his planned 2024
campaign announcement,

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:21.914
so now he has to come up with
a new explanation

00:01:21.914 --> 00:01:23.750
for what his big announcement
was.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.186
"Uh, we're launching Trump brand
hard seltzer."

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:28.454
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:29.622
"That was always the plan

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:33.526
and not something
we just threw together."

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:37.596
Pennsylvania Republican Senate
candidate Dr. Mehmet Oz conceded

00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:38.865
yesterday in a phone call

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.365
to Lieutenant Governor
John Fetterman.

00:01:40.365 --> 00:01:41.667
Fetterman knew it was him

00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:44.203
because it was not
a Pennsylvania number.

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:48.140
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.977
Ex-Trump organization CFO Allen
Weisselberg recently testified

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:54.613
that former President Trump
inflated the value of

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.016
his Trump Tower apartment
by $200 million,

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.253
which he did by claiming
it was a two-bedroom.

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:04.624
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.927
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.927 --> 00:02:11.230
It's a joke about New York City
real estate, but...

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.998
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.998 --> 00:02:14.467
I'll explain
during the commercial.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:19.973
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.643
A T-Rex dinosaur skull will go
up for auction next month and is

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.980
expected to sell for 20 million
of Nic Cage's dollars.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:30.316
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:33.252
A professional archer in Denmark
recently broke a Guinness

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:35.854
world record by shooting
seven arrows through a keyhole.

00:02:35.854 --> 00:02:38.491
Great for him, terrible for
his nosy neighbor.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:43.962
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.962 --> 00:02:45.231
Is that a two-bedroom?

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.201
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:53.373
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.507
Phew.

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:57.243
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:00.646
And finally, organizers of the
Westminster Kennel Club Dog Show

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.148
have announced that next year's
event will be moved

00:03:03.148 --> 00:03:04.484
from Madison Square Garden

00:03:04.484 --> 00:03:07.286
to Billie Jean King National
Tennis Center in Queens.

00:03:07.286 --> 00:03:09.222
What could possibly go wrong?

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.357
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.060
That was a monologue, everybody.
We're off.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.395
We got a great show for you
tonight.

